OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1785872169
OL,3,CMusic stars and fans gather for
OL,4,Cfuneral of Glen Hansard
OL,6,FMourners at the funeral of Oscar-
OL,7,Fwinning musician Glen Hansard have
OL,8,Fheard that his remarkable gifts
OL,9,Fbrought him "from the streets of
OL,10,FDublin to audiences across the globe".
OL,12,FU2 frontman Bono, bandmate The Edge
OL,13,Fand Pearl Jam singer Eddie Vedder were
OL,14,Famong the stars who joined family,
OL,15,Ffriends and fans for the service at St
OL,16,FPatrick's Cathedral in Dublin on
OL,17,FTuesday.
OL,19,FBono addressed the funeral and led the
OL,20,Fcongregation in a singalong of the U2
OL,21,Fsong Beautiful Day.
OL,26,@qD@MOUrD@eO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/19
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
