PN,41302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1785872169
OL,3,CMusic stars and fans gather for
OL,4,Cfuneral of Glen Hansard
OL,6,FWith the cathedral full, hundreds more
OL,7,Fgathered outside to watch the
OL,8,Fproceedings on large screens which had
OL,9,Fbeen erected while more than 40,000
OL,10,Fwatched a livestream of the funeral.
OL,12,FThe funeral featured multiple musical
OL,13,Ftributes as well as memories shared by
OL,14,Ffamily members.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/19
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
