PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1785872169
OL,3,CMusic stars and fans gather for
OL,4,Cfuneral of Glen Hansard
OL,6,FTributes poured in from around the
OL,7,Fworld after Hansard, the frontman of
OL,8,FIrish band The Frames was killed at
OL,9,Fthe age of 56 in a motorcycle crash on
OL,10,Fthe outskirts of Dublin last week,
OL,11,Fhours after taking part in a trad
OL,12,Fsession at The Wren's Nest pub.
OL,14,FHansard featured in celebrated film
OL,15,FThe Commitments, and won an Oscar for
OL,16,Fbest original song for Falling Slowly
OL,17,Fin 2008, which he co-wrote with
OL,18,FMarketa Irglova for the movie Once.
OL,26,@zD@ErrzD@Orp
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/19
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
