PN,41304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1785872169
OL,3,CMusic stars and fans gather for
OL,4,Cfuneral of Glen Hansard
OL,6,FHe began an annual Christmas Eve
OL,7,Fcharity busk outside the Gaiety
OL,8,FTheatre 16 years ago, drawing members
OL,9,Fof the public to see famous Irish
OL,10,Fmusicians perform in aid of the
OL,11,Fhomeless in the city.
OL,13,FMusicians Hozier, Declan O'Rourke,
OL,14,FJerry Fish and Imelda May were among
OL,15,Fthe first to arrive at the cathedral.
OL,17,FActors Steve Coogan and Chris O'Dowd
OL,18,Fwere also in attendance, as well as
OL,19,Fformer Sinn Fein president Gerry Adams
OL,20,Fand traditional musician Finbar Furey.
OL,26,@{D@Nrr
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/19
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
