FL,414,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1785872169
OL,3,CMusic stars and fans gather for
OL,4,Cfuneral of Glen Hansard
OL,6,FMembers of the public applauded as the
OL,7,Ffuneral procession arrived at the
OL,8,Fcathedral with the hearse being pulled
OL,9,Fby four horses, before the wicker
OL,10,Fcoffin, adorned with green branches,
OL,11,Fwas carried inside.
OL,13,FRev Dr William Morton, the dean of St
OL,14,FPatrick's Cathedral, welcomed mourners
OL,15,Fand accepted the gift of a guitar at
OL,16,Fthe altar.
OL,18,FRev Morton said the service was being
OL,19,Fheld "in thanksgiving for and in
OL,20,Fcelebration" of Hansard's "life,
OL,21,Ftalent, generosity and kindness".
OL,26,@{D@FOU|D@LO]|D@[OU}D@`O]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/19
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
