PN,41306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1785872169
OL,3,CMusic stars and fans gather for
OL,4,Cfuneral of Glen Hansard
OL,6,FBreanndan O Beaglaoich read a poem and
OL,7,Fthen described Hansard as a "one-off
OL,8,Fperson the likes of which we won't
OL,9,Fmeet again".
OL,11,FHe said: "He was so well-known on the
OL,12,Fbig stages of Ireland and all over the
OL,13,Fworld.
OL,15,F"But to us, who were close to him, he
OL,16,Fwas an ordinary, kind-hearted Ballymun
OL,17,Fman. A true Dub."
OL,26,@nD@HrpnD@KrgoD@]OUqD@KO]sD@JOUwD@AOUyD@
OL,26,AQO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/19
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
