OL,3,CMusic stars and fans gather for
OL,4,Cfuneral of Glen Hansard
OL,6,FHansard's younger brother Richard told
OL,7,Fthe service said his brother had a
OL,8,F"way of making you feel like you
OL,9,Fmattered".
OL,11,FHe said: "Glen made me feel like the
OL,12,Fworld was a much more magical place
OL,13,Fthan it was at the time.
OL,15,F"He sang songs, he was a storyteller,
OL,16,Fhe would come in and turn the evening
OL,17,Faround. It was easy to look up and be
OL,18,Finspired.
OL,26,@pD@AOUqD@IO]sD@JOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G7/19
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,414,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1785872169
OL,3,CMusic stars and fans gather for
OL,4,Cfuneral of Glen Hansard
OL,6,F"I know he made ripples and made
OL,7,Fwaves. He had an impact on so many,
OL,8,Flook at this room.
OL,10,F"Those waves began at kitchen tables
OL,11,Fin Ballymun and Killester, and it is
OL,12,Fat those tables for us he will remain.
OL,13,FHis first stage was our house and his
OL,14,Faudience was his mam, dad and
OL,15,Fbrothers."
OL,17,FHe added: "We have inherited all the
OL,18,Fmagical, colourful words, hugs, talks,
OL,19,Fmadness, sadness, insightful manic
OL,20,Fbeauty that a brother, an uncle, a
OL,21,Fhusband, and a father could ever give.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOUyD@KOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G8/19
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
