PN,41309
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1785872169
OL,3,CMusic stars and fans gather for
OL,4,Cfuneral of Glen Hansard
OL,6,F"Thank you, Glen. Thank you, brother.
OL,7,FThank you, thank you, thank you, thank
OL,8,Fyou, thank you."
OL,10,FHansard's wife Maire thanked the
OL,11,Femergency personnel who came to her
OL,12,Fhusband's aid following last week's
OL,13,Faccident.
OL,15,FShe told the funeral: "I owe my
OL,16,Fdeepest gratitude to all our good
OL,17,Ffriends who have spared no effort to
OL,18,Fgive me to guide me through this time.
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@PO]wD@WOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G9/19
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,414,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41310
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1785872169
OL,3,CMusic stars and fans gather for
OL,4,Cfuneral of Glen Hansard
OL,6,F"As Glen's wife, I want to thank him
OL,7,Ffor the life we shared, searching for
OL,8,Ftruth and beauty side by side. We
OL,9,Ffound it in our son Christie."
OL,11,FShe received a prolonged round of
OL,12,Fapplause after reading a poem she had
OL,13,Fwritten for her husband.
OL,15,FVedder then sang Hansard's The Song Of
OL,16,FGood Hope, with Irglova, alongside
OL,17,Fwhom the Dublin musician had won an
OL,18,FOscar.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@^O]xD@Wrp
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G10/19
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
