PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1785872169
OL,3,CMusic stars and fans gather for
OL,4,Cfuneral of Glen Hansard
OL,6,FDelivering his address, Rev Morton
OL,7,Ftold mourners that Hansard would be
OL,8,Fremembered for the goodness he brought
OL,9,Finto the lives of others.
OL,11,FHe said: "His untimely death is a
OL,12,Fprofound loss to his wife Maire, young
OL,13,Fson Christie, all the family, and his
OL,14,Fcountless friends.
OL,16,F"But it is also a profound loss to the
OL,17,Fworld of music in Ireland and far
OL,18,Fbeyond these shores.
OL,26,@sD@JOUxD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G11/19
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,414,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41312
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1785872169
OL,3,CMusic stars and fans gather for
OL,4,Cfuneral of Glen Hansard
OL,6,F"Glen's remarkable gifts and
OL,7,Foutstanding talent, which touched so
OL,8,Fmany hearts, took him from the streets
OL,9,Fof Dublin to audiences across the
OL,10,Fglobe.
OL,12,F"His songs will continue to be loved
OL,13,Ffor generations to come."
OL,15,FRev Morton said Hansard would also be
OL,16,Fremembered for his "generosity, his
OL,17,Fhumility, his warmth, and his insight.
OL,18,Fhis instinctive kindness.
OL,20,FHe said: "He always had time,
OL,21,Fcompassion for people.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUuD@YO]xD@TOU|D@JOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G12/19
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,414,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41313
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1785872169
OL,3,CMusic stars and fans gather for
OL,4,Cfuneral of Glen Hansard
OL,6,F"He delighted in encouraging others.
OL,7,FHe responded quietly to human need,
OL,8,Fand never seemed to lose the ability
OL,9,Fto see the individual behind the crowd.
OL,11,F"There was a gentleness about him that
OL,12,Fdrew people towards him, the
OL,13,Fgenerosity of heart that left them
OL,14,Fbetter for having met him, gave a gift
OL,15,Fof making others feel seen, valued,
OL,16,Fand loved."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUxD@KO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G13/19
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
