PN,41314
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1785872169
OL,3,CMusic stars and fans gather for
OL,4,Cfuneral of Glen Hansard
OL,6,FHe said Hansard had "never lost sight
OL,7,Fof his roots, or of the importance of
OL,8,Fhuman connection", drawing attention
OL,9,Fto the Christmas Eve busk and his
OL,10,Fcharity fundraising efforts during the
OL,11,FCovid pandemic.
OL,13,FHe said: "Glen's life therefore
OL,14,Freminds us that in a world so often
OL,15,Fcaptivated by success and acclaim,
OL,16,Fkindness offered freely and
OL,17,Fconsistently that is remembered
OL,18,Flongest and leaves the deepest mark.
OL,26,@nD@UOUpD@QO]uD@JOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G14/19
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,414,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41315
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1785872169
OL,3,CMusic stars and fans gather for
OL,4,Cfuneral of Glen Hansard
OL,6,F"Kindness will always live on in the
OL,7,Fhearts of those whose lives we have
OL,8,Ftouched.
OL,10,F"Glen understood that. In the end,
OL,11,Fthat is the greatest legacy anyone can
OL,12,Fleave.
OL,14,F"Songs may become part of our culture,
OL,15,Fbut kindness becomes part of other
OL,16,Fpeople's lives."
OL,18,FBono told the funeral that Glen had
OL,19,Fthousands of "best friends".
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOUvD@AOUxD@PO]{D@NOU{D@[O]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G15/19
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
