OL,3,CMusic stars and fans gather for
OL,4,Cfuneral of Glen Hansard
OL,6,FHe then played on his phone a tribute
OL,7,Fthat had been sent to him from Patti
OL,8,FSmith following Hansard's death.
OL,10,FBono then read lyrics from the U2 song
OL,11,F'Beautiful Day' and led the mourners
OL,12,Fin a singalong.
OL,14,FAt the end of the service, Hothouse
OL,15,FFlowers singer Liam O Maonlai led
OL,16,Fperformers and the congregation in a
OL,17,Frendition of the Bob Dylan song
OL,18,FForever Young.
OL,26,@wD@UrgwD@]rt
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G16/19
