OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1785872169
OL,3,CMusic stars and fans gather for
OL,4,Cfuneral of Glen Hansard
OL,6,FSeveral people had queued outside the
OL,7,Fcathedral for hours to attend the
OL,8,Fservice.
OL,10,FAmong those who attended was Stefania
OL,11,FDomesi from Italy.
OL,13,FShe said: "I was here and then I heard
OL,14,Fabout the funeral and the wake and I
OL,15,Fthought it was good to come.
OL,17,F"I really was astonished by the person
OL,18,Fthat I was so I thought it was nice to
OL,19,Fcome here.
OL,26,@uD@KOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G17/19
