OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1785872169
OL,3,CMusic stars and fans gather for
OL,4,Cfuneral of Glen Hansard
OL,6,F"He was not just a musician and artist
OL,7,Fbut he was a great person and he
OL,8,Fshowed it in all his life."
OL,10,FTheresa Martin travelled from Co
OL,11,FWaterford to attend the funeral and
OL,12,Fwas in the queue to enter the church.
OL,14,FShe said: "It was just the feeling
OL,15,Fthat he brought to the music. You
OL,16,Fcould see it in his eyes and his face.
OL,18,F"It was true stories as well. It was
OL,19,Funique."
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@[O]vD@KOUzD@AOU{D@HO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G18/19
